### Ny ordre krever innlogging. Kundenummeret hentes fra sesjonen,
### så vi sender IKKE med brukernavn.

### 1. Uten innlogging gir 401
POST http://localhost:3030/ordrer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "kurv": [
        { "vnr": "10820", "antall": 2, "pris": 66.5 }
    ]
}

### 2. Logg inn (REST Client husker cookien)
POST http://localhost:3030/innlogging HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epost": "paaa@abc.no",
    "passord": "laap"
}

### 3. Ny ordre (201)
POST http://localhost:3030/ordrer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "kurv": [
        { "vnr": "10820", "antall": 2, "pris": 66.5 }
    ]
}

### 4. Tom handlekurv gir 400
POST http://localhost:3030/ordrer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "kurv": []
}

### 5. Logg ut
POST http://localhost:3030/utlogging HTTP/1.1
